{'symbol': 'WAT', 'date': '2020-12-10 07:30:00', 'title': 'WATERS CORPORATION APPOINTS PEARL S. HUANG TO BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': 'MILFORD, MASS.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--WATERS CORPORATION (NYSE:WAT) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT DR. PEARL S. HUANG, PRESIDENT AND CEO OF CYGNAL THERAPEUTICS AND VENTURE PARTNER AT FLAGSHIP PIONEERING, HAS BEEN APPOINTED AS A DIRECTOR OF WATERS CORPORATION, EFFECTIVE JANUARY 1, 2021. “WE ARE PLEASED TO WELCOME PEARL TO THE WATERS BOARD OF DIRECTORS,” SAID DR. FLEMMING ORNSKOV, CHAIRMAN OF THE BOARD. “PEARL IS A DISTINGUISHED EXECUTIVE WITH SIGNIFICANT SCIENTIFIC EXPERTISE IN THE DISCOVERY OF BIOLOGICS, SMAL'}